  "description": "Generic HTTP/REST IExternalComputeDispatcher for ToolUp — hands a unit of work to any HTTP compute service (a training server, an inference endpoint, a batch REST facade) via config-driven submit / status / cancel requests, with dotted-path JSON selectors reading the job id, status, progress and result reference back out. Registers the completion-callback credential so push-completion works where the service supports webhooks. BCL HttpClient only; no vendor SDK. Server-only companion.",
